Q. Managed vs External delta tables

Metastore? hive or unity metastore - repository store all definition of tables, schema, or catalog schema / metadata informatiion.
default: managed table is created in databricks
Metastore - catalog, schema, table definition is stored but data is stored in cloud storage (default data lake given to databricks)


If we want to drop the table - the databricks will delete the data and metadata both.

External delta tables - 
metastore - stores metadata
cloud storage (own), we have default storage also
When table is dropped - metadata is removed, but data is not dropped from my storage account 


