Q. Data versioning
Keep track of all the changes happened in the table
DESCRIBE HISTORY tablename;

Q.Time travel
Why history? you can time travel to a specific version or timestamp
SELECT * FROM tablename VERSION AS OF 2;

RESTORE tablename TO VERSION AS OF 2;

Q. VACUUM command - delete the files that are no longer needed (retention duration check is 7 days - not to use in productions)

VACUUM tablename
We lose time travel, we cannot go back to that version.
VACUUM tablename RETAIN 0 HOURS


