Q. Auto Loader - incremental loading 
architecture provided by databricks
We used Streaming dataframe - 

continuous stream of data - AutoLoader (incrementally load into destination)
cloudfiles - generic file format
schema - we store the schema with is referred by cloudfiles writer method
checkpoint location - to keep track of files successfully processed or read

df = spark.readStream.format('cloudFiles')\
        .option('cloudFiles.format','parquet')\
        .option('cloudFiles.schemaLocation','path- can store it in source or destination')
        .load('location_of_path')

df.writeStream.format('delta')\
    .option('checkpointlocation','path')\
    .trigger(availableNow=True) #0.5 ms by default
    or 
    .trigger(processingtime='5 seconds')\
    .start('load it destination path')


